'' '-Os' IS SIZE (2026-11-25). fbc read it as valint( "s" ) = 0 and built at -O0 in silence
'' (F-64); tiko refused it with TKO0106 until it meant something. clang now gets -Os, and
'' __FB_OPTIMIZE__ reads 2. Anything else that is not a level is still refused.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -v --no-module-cache -Os -c tests/driver/src/multi-c-a.bas -o tests/driver/optlevels.o
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: -Os -ffunction-sections
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/driver/optlevels.o
